                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4960/77.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Ambassador
                    Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Acknowledges Mr. Irishman’s No. 48, expresses appreciation, and extends
                    congratulations.</p>
